# Independent B4a static review: APPROVED

No actionable findings in the reviewed B4a source change. Approval covers this bounded runtime-routing increment only; it does not establish executed rejection lifecycle behavior or authorize a campaign.

Reviewed the binding B4a prompt, recovery design/plan, B3b principal approval and verification, B4a report/diff/verification and archived-input inspection script, plus the relevant runtime, rendering, identity, payload, repository, selection and record-construction source paths. No production code was changed.

